<title>USA: U.S. Surgical to lower offer for Circon - WSJ.</title>
<headline>U.S. Surgical to lower offer for Circon - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Surgical Corp is expected to reduce its offer for Circon Corp by $1 a share to $17 a share, or about $234 million, The Wall Street Journal reported Monday.</p>
<p>The drop is due to the surgical equipment company's lackluster third quarter results, the story says.</p>
<p>U.S. Surgical launched a hostile $18-a-share tender offer in early August, the story says.</p>
